    <fr:title text="FollowLast Sets in Dependent Lambek Calculus">FollowLast Sets in Dependent Lambek Calculus</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>
  The <fr:link href="/sss-0010/" title="FollowLast Set" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-0010/" display-uri="sss-0010" type="local">followlast set</fr:link> of a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> may be captured in Dependent Lambek Calculus via the following proposition:

  <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[ c \not  \in  \mathsf {FLast}(A) := A \And  (A \otimes  \texttt {"}c\texttt {"} \otimes  \top ) \vdash  \bot ]]></fr:tex></html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
